# AI session brief + project ledger — kept LOCAL, never in the public repo.
# (2026-05-28: split out of CLAUDE.md / CHRONOLOGY.md / DECISIONS.md.)
# Pattern: any *.local.md is treated as private by convention. The split
# follows Claude Code's own convention — it reads both CLAUDE.md and
# CLAUDE.local.md when present, so the operator keeps full context on
# their machine while public viewers see only README.md + the operational
# docs under docs/.
*.local.md


